#~ " tool list and `status`, which tells it to "
#~ "ask you to sign in to Cadrumo. The client "
#~ "can run only operations allowed by its current "
#~ "session and, for a key, its grant."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A telepített `cadrumo-mcp` parancs egy MCP-klienst"
